        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Mul-T-Lock Adonis Plymouth Style Grade 2 Commercial Security Door Knobs\r\n</b>\r\n<p>\r\nMUL-T-LOCK's  cylindrical locksets are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. Each keyed function Lockset is fitted with a MUL-T-LOCK 206S High Security lock cylinder. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n Also available \r\n<a href=\"/products/mul-t-lock-high-security-lock-commercial-door-lever-lockset\"><b>MUL-T-LOCK Grade 2 ADA  Compliant Lever</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/mul-t-lock-high-security-lock-ball-door-knob-lockset\"><b>MUL-T-LOCK Ball Style Security Door Knobs</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nVarious functions available for just about any application. Like all MUL-T-LOCK Products the Adonis line of Locksets are protected by MUL-T-LOCK's Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty. All keyed functions are supplied with two (2) keys and owner key card. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features </b> for Mul-T-Lock Grade 2 Commercial Security Knobs\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI Grade 2 Locking Mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Lock Design</li>\r\n<li>Mul-T-Lock 206S Security Keyway</li>\r\n<li>2 Keys per Lock</li>\r\n<li>UL Fire Rated Latch</li>\r\n<li>Easy to Grip Plymouth Style Knob</li>\r\n<li>Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" Backset Latch</li>\r\n<li>UL437 Drill and Pick Resistance Cylinder</li>\r\n<!-- <li>US26D <b>Satin Chrome Finish</b></li> -->\r\n<!-- <li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li> -->\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMUL-T-LOCK's locks are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. The Key Card owner is the only person allowed to have the keys duplicated. Remove the worry about anyone making duplicates of your keys. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Passage:</b> Both Knobs are always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy:</b> Push button locking inside. Can be unlocked from outside with small screwdriver.</li>\r\n<li><b>Entrance Lock:</b> Push button locking inside. Keyed locking outside.</li>\r\n<li><b>Classroom Lock:</b> Outside Knob locked and unlocked by key. Inside knob always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom Lock:</b> Outside Knob fixed, entrance by key only. Inside knob always unlocked.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Mul-T-Lock Adonis Grade 2 Plymouth Style Security Door Knob Lockset",
                "description": "LCK-AK29 Mul-T-Lock Adonis Grade 2 Commercial  Plymouth Style Knobs. High security restricted key  Grade 2 Plymouth Style commercial door knobs. Available in passage, privacy, keyed entry, classroom or storeroom functions in Bright Brass or  Satin Chrome.\r\n\r\n",
